709
00:41:48,820 --> 00:41:53,820
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: At i-embed dito yung tinatawag natin, human resource management information system,

710
00:41:53,820 --> 00:41:56,280
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: umang Hurman system, and payroll system,

711
00:41:56,280 --> 00:42:01,760
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: which hopefully will digitalize all these processes and um transactions,

712
00:42:01,820 --> 00:42:04,640
