715
00:42:15,200 --> 00:42:16,720
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi sa prime HRM.

716
00:42:16,720 --> 00:42:18,640
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: All documents based.

717
00:42:18,640 --> 00:42:23,120
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kung may panahon na may mag-check or may mag-assess, doon lang titignan.

718
