CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Medyo document-based, hindi siya accurate measure of how we manage our human resources in government.

721
00:42:38,200 --> 00:42:46,740
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: It will take a long time because the pilot for the PCSMP is 40 departments, 40 agencies.

722
00:42:46,740 --> 00:42:56,060
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: But in case na merong mga agencies na hindi po makakapapasok sa transition sa Prime ESG,

723
00:42:56,560 --> 00:43:06,680
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: nag-gunguha po kami ng dagdag na 20 agencies to fill in if there are people who will not be able to get into the transition

724
00:43:06,680 --> 00:43:15,980
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: so that yung target ng PCSMP na at least 40 agencies of government for its first rollout phase will be net.

725
00:43:16,740 --> 00:43:23,460
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: We will be transitioning, we will finish the transition period for Prime ESG

726
00:43:23,460 --> 00:43:29,300
