745
00:44:46,740 --> 00:44:50,180
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Mayroon pong proseso na pag-aaralan ng Department of Justice.

746
00:44:50,200 --> 00:44:55,460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Are you saying, attorney, may mga files tayo na nakalagay pa sa folder?

747
00:44:55,760 --> 00:44:56,500
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Karamihan po.

748
00:44:56,980 --> 00:44:57,660
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Tao natin?

749
00:44:57,840 --> 00:44:58,500
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Karamihan po.

